# Local configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Temporary outputs; keep reusable source assets outside these directories.
# Everything under an artifacts/ directory is local output and stays out of Git;
# the only exception is the index that explains the layout. Durable evidence
# (reopen records, netlists, check scripts, render gallery) lives in the tracked
# hardware/records/, enclosure/ and enclosure/renders/ directories instead.
**/artifacts/**
!projects/nfc-business-card/artifacts/README.md
downloads/
logs/
*.log

# Local EDA smoke test and transient SQLite files
/eda/AI-API-Smoke-Test.eprj2
/eda/*_backup/
/eda/*.eproj2-backup/
/eda/*.eprj2-journal
/eda/*.eprj2-wal
/eda/*.eprj2-shm
